//RS /// Core modules (math, encoding.json) are checked in the same bundle as the
//RS /// user's file. Their parser, registration and body lints are library facts:
//RS /// none may reach the user's lint stream, and no lint may point outside the
//RS /// user's source (a Core byte offset rendered at the entry file's EOF).
